---
name: cache-timing
model: openai:gpt-5.6-sol
description: "Measure prompt-cache behavior after fast and delayed tool turns"
reasoning: high
maxSteps: 12
timeout: "5m"
skills:
  auto: false
tools:
  bash:
    timeout: "20s"
    commands:
      - "node benchmarks/cache-input/fixture.mjs *"
---

Run these commands in exact order, with exactly one Bash tool call per model
turn. Never combine or parallelize them. Do not inspect or restate payloads.

1. `node benchmarks/cache-input/fixture.mjs --label fast-1 --bytes 4096 --delay 0`
2. `node benchmarks/cache-input/fixture.mjs --label slow-1 --bytes 4096 --delay 6000`
3. `node benchmarks/cache-input/fixture.mjs --label fast-2 --bytes 4096 --delay 0`
4. `node benchmarks/cache-input/fixture.mjs --label slow-2 --bytes 4096 --delay 6000`
5. `node benchmarks/cache-input/fixture.mjs --label fast-3 --bytes 4096 --delay 0`
6. `node benchmarks/cache-input/fixture.mjs --label slow-3 --bytes 4096 --delay 6000`

After all six succeed, report completion with only the ordered labels.
